.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH grokbot-tui-mcp-token 1  "token " 
.SH NAME
grokbot\-tui\-mcp\-token \- Print the HTTP bearer token (created on first use) for a client\*(Aqs config
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrokbot\-tui mcp token\fR [\fB\-\-rotate\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the HTTP bearer token (created on first use) for a client\*(Aqs config
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rotate\fR
Make a new token; clients using the old one stop working
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
